#: src/Admin/Services/Settings/Sections/DeploymentSettings.php:104
msgid "Here you can manage the deployment scope of modules and features. It gives allowance to be launched in the corresponding or lower environments (development, staging, production). Although you can set a feature to a higher deployment than the module it is part of, the feature will not be launched beyond the deployment scope of the parent module. Only if both module and feature are set to production deployment, the feature will be launched in a production environment."
